The local ONNX graph wrappers and sparse exporter contain adaptations of:
  MMDetection3D/projects/BEVFusion/tools/export_bevfusion_split.py
  MMDetection3D/projects/CenterPoint/tools/scn_onnx_exporter.py
from the OpenMMLab MMDetection3D source tree, under Apache License 2.0.
These modules are maintained in lidar-inference-tool and have no runtime
imports or subprocess dependencies on the source deployment tools.
